temFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">爆了！千问大模型直连淘宝：AI带货的“终极形态”来了？</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI成立咨询子公司DeployCo并收购Tomoro以强化企业AI落地服务</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic 推出 Claude Code Agent View 功能，实现多任务后台集中调度</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达2026年已投入400亿美元布局AI产业链，涵盖OpenAI及多家上市公司</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达2026年以来在AI领域动作频频，已承诺投入超过400亿美元用于股权交易，旨在深耕AI全产业链。核心投资包括向OpenAI注资30亿美元，进一步强化战略纽带。在公开市场，英伟达宣布了七项十亿级投资协议，重点布局底层材料与基础设施，其中玻璃基板制造商康宁公司获投最高32亿美元，数据中心运营商IREN获投约21亿美元。在初创企业层面，英伟达今年已参与约24轮私募融资。市场分析指出，英伟达通过将芯片客户转化为“利益共同体”的投资模式，虽引发了关于“循环交易”及潜在泡沫的争议，但此举正加速其从单一硬件供应商向掌控全产业链的核心资本力量转型，旨在构建难以逾越的竞争护城河。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度发布Ernie 5.1模型：预训练成本降低94%，位列全球Search排行榜第四</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6a992a7ad6a664ddd7e7be60b2da4c3f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度于2026年5月11日正式发布新一代语言模型Ernie 5.1。该模型基于2.4万亿参数的Ernie 5.0底座，通过“一次性弹性训练框架”实现多种尺寸模型优化，预训练成本仅为同类模型的6%。截至5月9日，Ernie 5.1在Arena Search排行榜以1223分位列全球第四、中国模型第一。架构上，Ernie 5.1参数量降至前作的三分之一，采用深度、宽度及活跃专家数量可调的子模型配置。为解决多技能训练中的“跷跷板效应”，百度应用四阶段后训练流程，结合策略蒸馏与强化学习，有效提升了编程与创造力表现。此外，重建的强化学习基础设施将更新、生成与评估解耦，显著增强了训练稳定性。目前，Ernie 5.1已集成至百度AI Studio及多款创意应用平台，在GPQA、MMLU-Pro等基准测试中展现出比肩Gemin</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">爆了！千问大模型直连淘宝：AI带货的“终极形态”来了？</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d1a48292d65fb5bbe0b78183b1b15486.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">千问大模型直连淘宝：AI带货的“终极形态”来了。AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · May 12, 202615大模型变现的路径正在被巨头们暴力打通。近日，通义千问与淘宝正式实现深度融合，这并非简单的跳转，而是将AI助手直接变成了“超级导购”。用户现在只需在千问App中动动嘴，就能完成从商品挑选、多平台比价到支付下单的全流程。这种转变标志着AI电商正从“辅助搜索工具”转型为“基础设施”。对于阿里而言，这不仅是AI战略的一次关键跃迁，更是为大模型商业化找到了一个实实在在的流量出口。购物体验：从“搜关键词”到“说人话”在实际操作中，这种“闭环购物”体验相当丝滑。传统的电商模式依赖用户手动输入关键词，然后在海量货架中反复筛选。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI成立咨询子公司DeployCo并收购Tomoro以强化企业AI落地服务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96a1bae977b7f3e2593c5df65697f51c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于本周一正式成立名为OpenAI Deployment Co.（简称DeployCo）的咨询子公司，旨在协助企业构建并部署复杂AI系统。为快速提升实战能力，OpenAI同步收购应用AI咨询与工程公司Tomoro，约150名资深工程师将并入新公司，直接驻扎客户现场提供技术支持。DeployCo拥有超过40亿美元初始运营资金，并获贝恩资本等机构支持。此举被视为对Anthropic近期组建部署团队的直接回应，旨在切入由埃森哲、德勤等巨头主导的咨询市场。OpenAI效仿Palantir的“前线部署工程师”模式，通过深度嵌入客户环境解决企业内部专业知识匮乏问题。尽管面临产品单一化、厂商锁定风险及与现有生态伙伴的竞争挑战，但此举标志着OpenAI正式进入AI价值变现的关键期，通过提供“送货上门”式的咨询服务，直</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic 推出 Claude Code Agent View 功能，实现多任务后台集中调度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ab7742c19edc16283651a5f2488dbbf0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic 旗下命令行编程工具 Claude Code 正式上线 Agent View 功能，旨在解决开发者处理多并行 AI 编程任务时的窗口管理与上下文切换难题。该功能目前处于“研究预览”阶段，开发者通过触发左箭头键或执行 claude agents 指令即可进入总览界面。Agent View 以行级颗粒度展示各会话状态，包括等待回复、运行中及已完成，支持在总览界面直接输入指令进行决策，无需切换完整窗口即可预览进展。此外，新增的后台处理能力支持通过 /bg 指令或 claude --bg 直接发起后台会话，显著提升了大规模并发任务的调度效率。目前，Agent View 已面向 Claude Pro、Max、Team、Enterprise 及 API 用户开放。这一更新标志着 AI 编程工具正从单一任务</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
